00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:16,840
between neurons which are the most active, and the ones which we wish to become more

93
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,080
active.

94
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:22,280
In a sense, the neurons that are firing while seeing a two, get more strongly linked to

95
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:25,440
those firing when thinking about a two.

96
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:28,960
To be clear, I really am not in a position to make statements one way or another about

