00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:18,280
We only have control over the weights and biases.

108
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:22,560
But just as with the last layer, it's helpful to just keep a note of what those desired

109
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,520
changes are.

110
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:28,720
But keep in mind, zooming out one step here, this is only what that digit two output neuron

