00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,640
just to classify all images as a two.

129
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:48,440
So, what you do is you go through this same back prop routine for every other training

130
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:53,680
example, recording how each of them would like to change the weights and the biases.

131
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:56,840
And you average together those desired changes.

132
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:08,160
This collection here of the averaged nudges to each weight and bias is, loosely speaking,

